<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>**Found<sp/>a<sp/>bug?**</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>Avoid<sp/>opening<sp/>any<sp/>new<sp/>issues<sp/>without<sp/>having<sp/>checked<sp/>if<sp/>your<sp/>problem<sp/>has<sp/>already<sp/>been<sp/>reported.<sp/>If<sp/>there<sp/>are<sp/>no<sp/>currently<sp/>open<sp/>issues<sp/>that<sp/>fit<sp/>your<sp/>problem&apos;s<sp/>description,<sp/>feel<sp/>free<sp/>to<sp/>[add<sp/>it](https://github.com/W2Codam/MLX42/issues/new/choose).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>When<sp/>writing<sp/>an<sp/>issue<sp/>make<sp/>sure<sp/>to<sp/>include<sp/>a<sp/>clear<sp/>title<sp/>and<sp/>description<sp/>as<sp/>well<sp/>as<sp/>having<sp/>filled<sp/>out<sp/>all<sp/>the<sp/>necessary<sp/>information:<sp/>System<sp/>info,<sp/>OS,<sp/>OS-Version,<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
