<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>Maybe<sp/>fix<sp/>it<sp/>yourself<sp/>:D<sp/>?</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Contributing</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Before<sp/>thinking<sp/>of<sp/>adding<sp/>a<sp/>contribution,<sp/>think.<sp/>Is<sp/>it<sp/>necessary?<sp/>Will<sp/>this<sp/>actually<sp/>be<sp/>a<sp/>useful/required<sp/>feature?<sp/>Is<sp/>your<sp/>implementation<sp/>good?</highlight></codeline>
